  "finding": "A unit that pushes 4 CP over its CPA and then rests, stage after stage, never collapses in 24 stages under option 1 (its level never falls below -4) but collapses at stage 13 under option 2, because a DP tally with no reset only grows. The rules give option 2 no reset, and the ruling notes one would have to be invented; any reset rule would move its collapse later."
